{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>佐敦一間便利店遇劫，損失數千元。賊人之後自首。</p><p></p><p>便利店女職員向警方講述案發經過。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.ROBBERY-0600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zDuszitmJn1792363591.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>警方指在清晨4時許，一名50多歲男子手持一塊磚頭，進入佐敦道9號一間便利店，搶走收銀機內5,200元後，持磚頭逃去。</p><p></p><p>賊人清晨約6時乘的士到大嶼山警署自首，正被扣查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:39:46.864494+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:38:05.114521+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:38:11.213383+00:00","content_hash":"193895d2e7e00c07d296f97184c3f46771c2b1ed179e059cfbef036bce2e4dac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}